1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240
In this session in your training day we're going to look at some of the more specialised holidays we offer at BC Travel.

2
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,068
Now, the travel business is very competitive

3
00:00:12,068 --> 00:00:17,320
and it's important to be aware of how the market's changing and developing.

4
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,060
In terms of age groups

5
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,340
the over-65s are an important market

6
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:26,410
and one that's increasing steadily year on year.

7
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:34,310
The fewest holidays are taken by the 31 to 42-year-olds, and that figure shows no sign of rising.

8
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:38,459
The biggest market at present is still the youngest group,

9
00:00:38,459 --> 00:00:45,512
the 16 to 30s, but this group's also seen the biggest drop over the last few years,

10
00:00:45,512 --> 00:00:52,150
whereas there's a noticeable growth in the number of holidays taken by the 55 to 64-year-olds.

11
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:56,211
As far as the 43 to 54-year-olds are concerned,

12
00:00:56,211 --> 00:01:03,430
bookings there are steady, but I have to say we haven't seen the increase we expected.

13
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:09,907
One trend we're noticing with nearly all age groups is the growing popularity of holidays in

14
00:01:09,907 --> 00:01:13,145
which clients do some kind of specialised activity.

15
00:01:13,145 --> 00:01:15,979
I'm not talking here about adventure holidays,

16
00:01:15,979 --> 00:01:22,860
where clients take part in high-risk activities like white water rafting just for the thrill of it.

17
00:01:22,860 --> 00:01:28,500
Activity holidays usually involve rather less high-risk sports

18
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:31,440
or things like art and music.

19
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:37,310
They're not necessarily cheaper than ordinary holidays, often the opposite, in fact.

20
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:41,316
But they do often take place outside the main tourist centres,

21
00:01:41,316 --> 00:01:47,142
which gives an opportunity for clients to find out more about the local people and customs,

22
00:01:47,142 --> 00:01:52,240
and many say this is one of the most positive features of these holidays.

23
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:56,560
Of course, they offer the chance to develop a new skill or talent

24
00:01:57,060 --> 00:02:00,798
but clients often say that more than this.

25
00:02:00,798 --> 00:02:06,910
It's the chance to create lasting relationships with other like-minded people that's the main draw.

26
00:02:06,910 --> 00:02:11,380
Let me give you some examples of BC Travel activity holidays.

27
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:16,365
Our painting holidays take place in four different centres in France

28
00:02:16,365 --> 00:02:22,710
and Italy and they're very popular with clients of all abilities from beginners onwards.

29
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:26,543
We've got an excellent team of artists to lead the classes -

30
00:02:26,543 --> 00:02:29,540
some of them have been with us from the start

31
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:33,511
and five additional ones will be joining us this year

32
00:02:33,511 --> 00:02:38,040
so that we can offer a greater number of classes in each centre.

33
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:40,816
As far as cooking holidays are concerned,

34
00:02:40,816 --> 00:02:43,800
I know a lot of agents offer holidays

35
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:47,558
where clients cook recipes related to one particular country,

36
00:02:47,558 --> 00:02:50,000
usually the one they're staying in

37
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,300
but we focus on dishes from a great many different ones.

38
00:02:54,300 --> 00:03:00,034
Apart from that you'll find the usual emphasis on good quality, organic ingredients -

39
00:03:00,034 --> 00:03:02,500
that's more or less a given nowadays

40
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:06,650
and there are generally some meat-free recipes included.

41
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:13,522
Our photography holidays take place in a wide range of countries from Iceland to Vietnam

42
00:03:13,522 --> 00:03:18,103
and clients have the opportunity to see some stunning scenery.

43
00:03:18,103 --> 00:03:20,720
Groups are small, no more than eight

44
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:25,433
so clients can have one-on-one tuition during the holiday,

45
00:03:25,433 --> 00:03:28,640
and excursions are arranged with fully-trained guides.

46
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:33,970
At the end of each holiday an exhibition is held of the photographs taken

47
00:03:33,970 --> 00:03:36,680
so that clients can see one another's work

48
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:39,680
and receive valuable feedback from the tutor.

49
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:43,680
Finally, let me tell you about our fitness holidays.

50
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:51,330
In Ireland and Italy we run one-week general fitness classes for all ages and levels of fitness.

51
00:03:51,330 --> 00:03:55,100
Clients start the course with a consultation with a trainer

52
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:58,910
and together they draw up an individual programme.

53
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,925
As well as improving general fitness,

54
00:04:00,925 --> 00:04:06,970
clients find that they end up losing much of the stress they've built up in their daily lives.

55
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:10,380
In Greece, we have a two-week holiday for clients

56
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:12,680
who want to do something about their weight.

57
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:17,596
This has all the features you'd expect, like a personalised diet programme,

58
00:04:17,596 --> 00:04:24,970
but one of its most popular features is that the exercise classes are all held on the beach.

59
00:04:24,970 --> 00:04:28,200
People say it's far preferable to being in a gym

60
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:31,900
Finally, we offer several holidays in Morocco.

61
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:35,830
One very popular one is the mountain biking holiday.

62
00:04:35,830 --> 00:04:40,830
Bikes are provided and there are different routes according to people's ability.

63
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:46,500
We offer one which is tailored to the needs of families, which is particularly popular.

64
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:52,020
OK, so that's about all the time I have today, so thank you very much...
